   "source": [
    "# Function With Return\n",
    "\n",
    "Given an integer n, You need to use the return keyword to return twice the value of n.\n",
    "\n",
    "Examples:\n",
    "\n",
    "Input: n = 2\n",
    "Output: 4\n",
    "Explanation: 2 * 2 = 4\n",
    "Input: n = 4\n",
    "Output: 8\n",
    "Explanation: 2 * 4 = 8"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7f964852",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "class Solution:\n",
    "    def returnValueFunction(self, n):\n",
    "        return 2*n\n",
    "        "
   ]
  }
